window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.rowsHtml+="<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1063\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχόμορος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: vizinho, contíguo, com genitivo; leitura duvidosa em Teócrito 25.203.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1064\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχονάω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo, de ἀγχόνη: estrangular, enforcar; Manílio 1.317, Suda.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1065\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχόνη</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino. I. Estrangulamento, enforcamento, suplício por suspensão; expressões trágicas e cômicas de ação merecedora de enforcamento; Ésquilo, Sófocles, Eurípides,</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1066\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχονίζω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo: estrangular, enforcar; passivo em escólio a Eurípides, Hipólito 780.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1067\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχόνιος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -α, -ον: destinado a enforcamento, próprio de laço ou nó de estrangulação; Eurípides, Nono.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1068\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχονιστής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino: carrasco encarregado de enforcar, executor de enforcamento; glossário.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1069\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχόσε</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Advérbio direcional: para perto, aproximando-se; Apolônio Díscolo, Advérbios 194.17.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1070\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχοτάτω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Advérbio superlativo de ἀγχοῦ: o mais perto possível, mais próximo, com genitivo ou dativo, espacialmente ou por semelhança; de parentes mais chegados; Heródoto, Eurípides.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1071\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχότερος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo comparativo -α, -ον: mais próximo, mais perto, com genitivo; advérbio ἀγχοτέρω, Heródoto, Apiano.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1072\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχοῦ</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Advérbio de proximidade, equivalente a ἄγχι: perto, junto, nas vizinhanças, com genitivo ou dativo; Homero, Arquíloco, Sófocles, Píndaro.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1073\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχούρης</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Glosa ἀγχούρης = πένης, «pobre, indigente»; Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1074\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγχουρος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo homógrafo A, -ον: vizinho, contíguo, confinante, com dativo ou genitivo; Antologia Palatina e Argonáuticas Órficas.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1075\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγχουρος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino homógrafo B: ouro, designação vinculada ao filho de Midas; Antologia Palatina 15.25.7, Plutarco.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1076\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχοῦρος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo: aurora, amanhecer, segundo glosa cipriota; Calímaco tinha leitura variante ἄγχαυρος e foi omitido no suplemento reescrito.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1077\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγχουσα</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: ancusa-dos-tintureiros, Anchusa tinctoria, planta tintorial; Teofrasto, Dioscórides. Comparar ἔγχουσα.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1078\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχουσίζομαι</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo médio: aplicar rubor ou cosmético ao rosto, corar-se com maquiagem; Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1079\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγχραν</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Glosa lócria ἄγχραν = μύωπα, «mosca-dos-olhos, mutuca», Hesíquio; identificação do inseto depende da glosa.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1079a\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχράνασθαι</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo médio ἀγχράνασθαι, por ἀναχρ-: ungir-se ou lavar-se, banhar-se; Hesíquio. Adição editorial ao LSJ.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1080\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχύνωψ</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ωπος: equivalente a φοῖνιξ, nome de planta em Dioscórides 4.43; sem impor a identificação botânica.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1081\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγχω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo, futuro ἄγξω. I. Apertar, comprimir, especialmente a garganta, sufocar, estrangular; Ilíada, Aristófanes, Demóstenes. II. Apertar em abraço ou luta corporal, agarrar e i</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1082\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγχώμαλος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: quase igual, equilibrado, de votação, disputa ou combate incerto; Tucídides, Josefo. Advérbio plural ἀγχώμαλα, combate em termos iguais, correspondente a aequo M</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>";
window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.cardsHtml+="<article id=\"entry-lsj-n1063\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1063\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1076\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχόμορος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: vizinho, contíguo, com genitivo; leitura duvidosa em Teócrito 25.203.\">ἀγχόμορος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: vizinho, contíguo, com genitivo; leitura duvidosa em Teócrito 25.203.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxo/moros&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1063&quot; key=&quot;a)gxo/moros&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχ-όμορος&quot;&gt;ἀγχόμορος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1063.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;neighbouring,&lt;/i&gt; c. gen., dub. in &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0005,001:25:203&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Theoc.&lt;/author&gt; 25.203&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1064\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1064\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1077\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχονάω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo, de ἀγχόνη: estrangular, enforcar; Manílio 1.317, Suda.\">ἀγχονάω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo, de ἀγχόνη: estrangular, enforcar; Manílio 1.317, Suda.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxona/w&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1064&quot; key=&quot;a)gxona/w&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχον-άω&quot;&gt;ἀγχονάω&lt;/head&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγχόνη&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n1064.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;strangle,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2583,001:1:317&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Man.&lt;/author&gt; 1.317&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Suid.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1065\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1065\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1078\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχόνη\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino. I. Estrangulamento, enforcamento, suplício por suspensão; expressões trágicas e cômicas de ação merecedora de enforcamento;\">ἀγχόνη</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino. I. Estrangulamento, enforcamento, suplício por suspensão; expressões trágicas e cômicas de ação merecedora de enforcamento; Ésquilo, Sófocles, Eurípides, Aristófanes. II. Nome de planta equiparado ao mandrágora em Pseudo-Dioscórides 4.75.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxo/nh&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1065&quot; key=&quot;a)gxo/nh&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχόν-η&quot;&gt;ἀγχόνη&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἄγχω&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n1065.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;strangling, hanging,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγχόνης . . τέρματα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,007:746&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Eu.&lt;/title&gt; 746&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἔργα κρείσσονʼ ἀγχόνης&lt;/foreign&gt; deeds too bad for &lt;i&gt;hanging,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,004:1374&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;OT&lt;/title&gt; 1374&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τάδʼ ἀγχόνης πέλας&lt;/foreign&gt; ʼtis nigh as bad as &lt;i&gt;hanging,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,004:246&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Heracl.&lt;/title&gt; 246&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ταῦτʼ οὐχὶ . . ἀγχόνης ἔστʼ ἄξια&lt;/quote&gt; ; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,017:246&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ba.&lt;/title&gt; 246&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ταῦτα . . οὐκ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; ; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,001:125&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ach.&lt;/title&gt; 125&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οἱ δʼ ἀγχόνην ἥψαντο&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0260,001:1:18&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Semon.&lt;/author&gt; 1.18&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;: rare in Prose, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. καὶ λύπη&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0026,002:38&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Aeschin.&lt;/author&gt; 2.38&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;:— in pl., &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν ἀγχόναις θάνατον λαβεῖν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,014:200&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Hel.&lt;/title&gt; 200&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. ib. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,014:299&quot;&gt;299&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,009:154&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;HF&lt;/title&gt; 154&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;αἱ ἀ. μάλιστα τοῖς νέοις&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,036:954b:35&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 954b35&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1065.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; = μανδραγόρα, Ps.-&lt;author&gt;Dsc.&lt;/author&gt; 4.75.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1066\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1066\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1079\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχονίζω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo: estrangular, enforcar; passivo em escólio a Eurípides, Hipólito 780.\">ἀγχονίζω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo: estrangular, enforcar; passivo em escólio a Eurípides, Hipólito 780.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxoni/zw&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1066&quot; key=&quot;a)gxoni/zw&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχον-ίζω&quot;&gt;ἀγχονίζω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1066.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;strangle,&lt;/i&gt; Sch. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,005:780&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Hipp.&lt;/title&gt; 780&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;).&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1067\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1067\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1080\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχόνιος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -α, -ον: destinado a enforcamento, próprio de laço ou nó de estrangulação; Eurípides, Nono.\">ἀγχόνιος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -α, -ον: destinado a enforcamento, próprio de laço ou nó de estrangulação; Eurípides, Nono.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxo/nios&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1067&quot; key=&quot;a)gxo/nios&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχόν-ιος&quot;&gt;ἀγχόνιος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;α&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1067.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;fit for strangling,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;βρόχος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,014:686&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Hel.&lt;/title&gt; 686&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;δεσμός&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2045,001:21:31&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Nonn.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;D.&lt;/title&gt; 21.31&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2045,001:34:229&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;34.229&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1068\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1068\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1081\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχονιστής\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino: carrasco encarregado de enforcar, executor de enforcamento; glossário.\">ἀγχονιστής</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino: carrasco encarregado de enforcar, executor de enforcamento; glossário.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxonisth/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1068&quot; key=&quot;a)gxonisth/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχον-ιστής&quot;&gt;ἀγχονιστής&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1068.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;hangman,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;Gloss.&lt;/title&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1069\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1069\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1082\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχόσε\" data-meanings=\"Advérbio direcional: para perto, aproximando-se; Apolônio Díscolo, Advérbios 194.17.\">ἀγχόσε</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Advérbio direcional: para perto, aproximando-se; Apolônio Díscolo, Advérbios 194.17.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxo/se&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1069&quot; key=&quot;a)gxo/se&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχόσε&quot;&gt;ἀγχόσε&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;sense id=&quot;n1069.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;coming near,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0082,002:194:17&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.D.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Adv.&lt;/title&gt; 194.17&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1070\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1070\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1083\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχοτάτω\" data-meanings=\"Advérbio superlativo de ἀγχοῦ: o mais perto possível, mais próximo, com genitivo ou dativo, espacialmente ou por semelhança; de parentes mais che\">ἀγχοτάτω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Advérbio superlativo de ἀγχοῦ: o mais perto possível, mais próximo, com genitivo ou dativo, espacialmente ou por semelhança; de parentes mais chegados; Heródoto, Eurípides.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxota/tw&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1070&quot; key=&quot;a)gxota/tw&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχοτάτω&quot;&gt;ἀγχοτάτω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt;, &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;comp&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Sup. of&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγχοῦ,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;sense id=&quot;n1070.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;nearest, next,&lt;/i&gt; c. gen., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0013,003:18&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;h.Ap.&lt;/title&gt; 18&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:2:169&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 2.169&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,020:620&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 620&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. τινός,&lt;/foreign&gt; of likeness, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:7:64&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 7.64&lt;/bibl&gt; (v.l. -ότατα), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:7:80&quot;&gt;80&lt;/bibl&gt;, al.; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τινί&lt;/foreign&gt; ib. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:7:91&quot;&gt;91&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οἱ ἀ. προσήκοντες&lt;/foreign&gt; the &lt;i&gt;nearest&lt;/i&gt; of kin, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:4:73&quot;&gt;4.73&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1071\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1071\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1084\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχότερος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo comparativo -α, -ον: mais próximo, mais perto, com genitivo; advérbio ἀγχοτέρω, Heródoto, Apiano.\">ἀγχότερος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo comparativo -α, -ον: mais próximo, mais perto, com genitivo; advérbio ἀγχοτέρω, Heródoto, Apiano.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxo/teros&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1071&quot; key=&quot;a)gxo/teros&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχότερος&quot;&gt;ἀγχότερος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;α&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;comp&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Comp. of&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγχοῦ,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;sense id=&quot;n1071.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;nearer,&lt;/i&gt; c. gen., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:7:175&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 7.175&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-οτέρω&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0551,017:1:57&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;App.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;BC&lt;/title&gt; 1.57&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1072\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1072\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1085\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχοῦ\" data-meanings=\"Advérbio de proximidade, equivalente a ἄγχι: perto, junto, nas vizinhanças, com genitivo ou dativo; Homero, Arquíloco, Sófocles, Píndaro.\">ἀγχοῦ</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Advérbio de proximidade, equivalente a ἄγχι: perto, junto, nas vizinhanças, com genitivo ou dativo; Homero, Arquíloco, Sófocles, Píndaro.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxou=&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1072&quot; key=&quot;a)gxou=&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχοῦ&quot;&gt;ἀγχοῦ&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1072.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἄγχι, &lt;i&gt;near,&lt;/i&gt; freq. in &lt;author&gt;Hom.&lt;/author&gt;, usu. in phrase &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγχοῦ δʼ ἱσταμένη&lt;/foreign&gt; (or &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-ος&lt;/foreign&gt;) &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:2:172&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 2.172&lt;/bibl&gt;, al.; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;στεῦται δʼ Ὀδυσῆος ἀκοῦσαι ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:17:526&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 17.526&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:19:271&quot;&gt;19.271&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. καθῆσθαι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Archil.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Supp.&lt;/title&gt; 3.3&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,001:962&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tr.&lt;/title&gt; 962&lt;/bibl&gt;: twice c. gen., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:24:709&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 24.709&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:6:5&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 6.5&lt;/bibl&gt;: c. dat., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,003:9:40&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;N.&lt;/title&gt; 9.40&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:3:85&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 3.85&lt;/bibl&gt;: in late Prose, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;λόγοι ἀ. τούτων&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0638,001:6:16&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Philostr.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;VA&lt;/title&gt; 6.16&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1073\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1073\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1086\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχούρης\" data-meanings=\"Glosa ἀγχούρης = πένης, «pobre, indigente»; Hesíquio.\">ἀγχούρης</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Glosa ἀγχούρης = πένης, «pobre, indigente»; Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxou/rhs&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1073&quot; key=&quot;a)gxou/rhs&quot; type=&quot;gloss&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχούρης·&quot;&gt;ἀγχούρης&lt;/head&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πένης,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1074\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1074\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1087\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγχουρος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo homógrafo A, -ον: vizinho, contíguo, confinante, com dativo ou genitivo; Antologia Palatina e Argonáuticas Órficas.\">ἄγχουρος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo homógrafo A, -ον: vizinho, contíguo, confinante, com dativo ou genitivo; Antologia Palatina e Argonáuticas Órficas.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/gxouros1&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1074&quot; key=&quot;a)/gxouros1&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγχουρος&quot;&gt;ἄγχουρος&lt;/head&gt; (A), &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγχι, οὖρος&lt;/etym&gt; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Ion.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; for &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὅρος&lt;/foreign&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n1074.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;neighbouring,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:9:235&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 9.235&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Crin.&lt;/author&gt;); &lt;i&gt;bordering on,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τινί&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0579,002:124&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Orph.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;A.&lt;/title&gt; 124&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τινός&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0341,002:418&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Lyc.&lt;/author&gt; 418&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1075\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1075\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1088\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγχουρος\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino homógrafo B: ouro, designação vinculada ao filho de Midas; Antologia Palatina 15.25.7, Plutarco.\">ἄγχουρος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino homógrafo B: ouro, designação vinculada ao filho de Midas; Antologia Palatina 15.25.7, Plutarco.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/gxouros2&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1075&quot; key=&quot;a)/gxouros2&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγχουρος&quot;&gt;ἄγχουρος&lt;/head&gt; (B), &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1075.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;gold,&lt;/i&gt; from the name of the son of Midas, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:15:25:7&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 15.25.7&lt;/bibl&gt; codd. (&lt;author&gt;Besant.&lt;/author&gt;), cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,085:306:f&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Par.min.&lt;/title&gt; 2.306f&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1076\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1076\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1089\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχοῦρος\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo: aurora, amanhecer, segundo glosa cipriota; Calímaco tinha leitura variante ἄγχαυρος e foi omitido no suplemento reescrito.\">ἀγχοῦρος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo: aurora, amanhecer, segundo glosa cipriota; Calímaco tinha leitura variante ἄγχαυρος e foi omitido no suplemento reescrito.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxou=ros3&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1076&quot; key=&quot;a)gxou=ros3&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχοῦρος&quot;&gt;ἀγχοῦρος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1076.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;dawn,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0533,009:260:64&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Call.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Hec.&lt;/title&gt; 1.4.10&lt;/bibl&gt; [Fr. 260.64 Pf. (reading ἄγχαυρος)]; Cypr. acc. to &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/sense&gt; [Supp. omits Call. from re-written entry]&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1077\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1077\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1090\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγχουσα\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: ancusa-dos-tintureiros, Anchusa tinctoria, planta tintorial; Teofrasto, Dioscórides. Comparar ἔγχουσα.\">ἄγχουσα</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino: ancusa-dos-tintureiros, Anchusa tinctoria, planta tintorial; Teofrasto, Dioscórides. Comparar ἔγχουσα.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/gxousa&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1077&quot; key=&quot;a)/gxousa&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγχουσα&quot;&gt;ἄγχουσα&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1077.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;alkanet, Anchusa tinctoria,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0093,001:7:8:3&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Thphr.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HP&lt;/title&gt; 7.8.3&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Dsc.&lt;/author&gt; 4.23; cf. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἔγχουσα&lt;/foreign&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1078\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1078\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1091\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχουσίζομαι\" data-meanings=\"Verbo médio: aplicar rubor ou cosmético ao rosto, corar-se com maquiagem; Hesíquio.\">ἀγχουσίζομαι</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo médio: aplicar rubor ou cosmético ao rosto, corar-se com maquiagem; Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxousi/zomai&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1078&quot; key=&quot;a)gxousi/zomai&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχουσίζομαι&quot;&gt;ἀγχουσίζομαι&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Med.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1078.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;rouge,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1079\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1079\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1092\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγχραν\" data-meanings=\"Glosa lócria ἄγχραν = μύωπα, «mosca-dos-olhos, mutuca», Hesíquio; identificação do inseto depende da glosa.\">ἄγχραν</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Glosa lócria ἄγχραν = μύωπα, «mosca-dos-olhos, mutuca», Hesíquio; identificação do inseto depende da glosa.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/gxran&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1079&quot; key=&quot;a)/gxran&quot; type=&quot;gloss&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγχραν·&quot;&gt;ἄγχραν&lt;/head&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μύωπα&lt;/foreign&gt; (&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Locr.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;), &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1079a\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1079a\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1093\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχράνασθαι\" data-meanings=\"Verbo médio ἀγχράνασθαι, por ἀναχρ-: ungir-se ou lavar-se, banhar-se; Hesíquio. Adição editorial ao LSJ.\">ἀγχράνασθαι</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo médio ἀγχράνασθαι, por ἀναχρ-: ungir-se ou lavar-se, banhar-se; Hesíquio. Adição editorial ao LSJ.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxra/nasqai&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1079a&quot; key=&quot;a)gxra/nasqai&quot; type=&quot;gloss&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχράνασθαι&quot;&gt;ἀγχράνασθαι&lt;/head&gt; (for &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀναχρ-&lt;/foreign&gt;), &lt;sense id=&quot;n1079a.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;anoint&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;wash oneself,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1080\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1080\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1094\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχύνωψ\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ωπος: equivalente a φοῖνιξ, nome de planta em Dioscórides 4.43; sem impor a identificação botânica.\">ἀγχύνωψ</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ωπος: equivalente a φοῖνιξ, nome de planta em Dioscórides 4.43; sem impor a identificação botânica.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxu/nwy&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1080&quot; key=&quot;a)gxu/nwy&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχύνωψ&quot;&gt;ἀγχύνωψ&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ωπος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1080.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= φοῖνιξ, &lt;author&gt;Dsc.&lt;/author&gt; 4.43.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1081\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1081\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1095\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγχω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo, futuro ἄγξω. I. Apertar, comprimir, especialmente a garganta, sufocar, estrangular; Ilíada, Aristófanes, Demóstenes. II. Apertar em abraço\">ἄγχω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo, futuro ἄγξω. I. Apertar, comprimir, especialmente a garganta, sufocar, estrangular; Ilíada, Aristófanes, Demóstenes. II. Apertar em abraço ou luta corporal, agarrar e imobilizar; Anacreônticas, Luciano. III. Figuradamente pressionar, constranger, de credores, consciência e alma. Médio: estrangular-se. Passivo: ser estrangulado, sufocado; também afogar-se, Hipócrates. Ausente da tragédia segundo o LSJ.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/gxw&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1081&quot; key=&quot;a)/gxw&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγχω&quot;&gt;ἄγχω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;fut.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγξω&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,010:638&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ec.&lt;/title&gt; 638&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0062,066:2:1&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Luc.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;DMort.&lt;/title&gt; 2[22].1&lt;/bibl&gt;: &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;aor. 1&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;mood opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;inf.&lt;/mood&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγξαι&lt;/foreign&gt; v.l. for ἄξαι &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0527,026:9:17&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;LXX&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;4 Ma.&lt;/title&gt; 9.17&lt;/bibl&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀπ-&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,005:796&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pax&lt;/title&gt; 796&lt;/bibl&gt;:—&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Med.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; and &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; (v. infr.) only in &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;pres.&lt;/tns&gt;:—&lt;sense id=&quot;n1081.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;squeeze,&lt;/i&gt; esp. the throat, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγχε μιν ἱμὰς ὑπὸ δειρήν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:3:371&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 3.371&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;i&gt;embrace,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μὴ θέλουσαν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;Anacreont.&lt;/title&gt; 57.22&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0650,001:1:18&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Herod.&lt;/author&gt; 1.18&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;i&gt;hug,&lt;/i&gt; in wrestling, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0650,001:2:12&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; 2.12&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0062,034:1&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Luc.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Anach.&lt;/title&gt; 1&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0525,001:8:40:2&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Paus.&lt;/author&gt; 8.40.2&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1600,001:1:6&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Philostr.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Im.&lt;/title&gt; 1.6&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;); &lt;i&gt;strangle, throttle,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τοὺς πατέρας ἦγχον νύκτωρ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,004:1039&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;V.&lt;/title&gt; 1039&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,010:638&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ec.&lt;/title&gt; 638&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,010:640&quot;&gt;640&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὸν Κέρβερον ἀπῇξας ἄγχων&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,009:468&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ra.&lt;/title&gt; 468&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,006:1575&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Av.&lt;/title&gt; 1575&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κἂν ταῦρον ἄγχοις&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,007:81&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lys.&lt;/title&gt; 81&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0433,001:29&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Crates Com.&lt;/author&gt; 29&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,054:20&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 54.20&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0005,001:5:106&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Theoc.&lt;/author&gt; 5.106&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:16:90&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;APl.&lt;/title&gt; 16.90&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν χαλινῷ τὰς σιαγόνας ἄ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0527,027:31&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;LXX&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ps.&lt;/title&gt; 31&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0527,027:32&quot;&gt;32&lt;/bibl&gt;). &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0527,027:9&quot;&gt;9&lt;/bibl&gt;: metaph., of pressing creditors, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,002:775&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Eq.&lt;/title&gt; 775&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0062,015:32&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Luc.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Symp.&lt;/title&gt; 32&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ψυχὴ ὑπὸ τοῦ σώματος ἀγχομένη&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;Corp.Herm.&lt;/title&gt; 10.24&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. 7.3; of a guilty conscience, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τοῦτο . . ἄγχει, σιωπᾶν ποιεῖ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,019:208&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 19.208&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;:—&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Med.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;i&gt;strangle oneself,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,023:2:68&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Morb.&lt;/title&gt; 2.68&lt;/bibl&gt;:—&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,003:1:46&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;N.&lt;/title&gt; 1.46&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,047:59&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 47.59&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0005,001:7:125&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Theoc.&lt;/author&gt; 7.125&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;i&gt;to be drowned,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,037:1&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Virg.&lt;/title&gt; 1&lt;/bibl&gt;.—Not in Trag.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1082\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1082\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1096\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγχώμαλος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: quase igual, equilibrado, de votação, disputa ou combate incerto; Tucídides, Josefo. Advérbio plural ἀγχώμαλα, combate em termos ig\">ἀγχώμαλος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: quase igual, equilibrado, de votação, disputa ou combate incerto; Tucídides, Josefo. Advérbio plural ἀγχώμαλα, combate em termos iguais, correspondente a aequo Marte pugnare; advérbio -άλως.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gxw/ma^los&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1082&quot; key=&quot;a)gxw/ma^los&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγχώμᾰλος&quot;&gt;ἀγχώμαλος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁμαλός&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n1082.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;nearly equal,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγχώμαλοι ἐν χειροτονίᾳ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:3:49&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 3.49&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. μάχη&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;a doubtful&lt;/i&gt; battle, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:4:134&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; 4.134&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὴν νίκην ἐν ἀγχωμάλῳ καταλιπόντες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0526,004:6:2:6&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;J.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;BJ&lt;/title&gt; 6.2.6&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὸ πλῆθος οὐκ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,048:42&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Caes.&lt;/title&gt; 42&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0081,001:5:14&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.H.&lt;/author&gt; 5.14&lt;/bibl&gt;:—neut. pl. as &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt;, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγχώμαλα ναυμαχεῖν,&lt;/foreign&gt; Lat. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;lat&quot;&gt;aequo Marte pugnare,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:7:71&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 7.71&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. σφισι ἐγένετο&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0062,063:12&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Luc.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Herm.&lt;/title&gt; 12&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-άλως&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0062,012:2:37&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;VH&lt;/title&gt; 2.37&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0551,001:11&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;App.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Praef.&lt;/title&gt; 11&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>";
